esh.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Presenting","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them in answer to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iOS document provider (","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform, through three protocols: a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" whose keys never leave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Secure Enclave, a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" under the device’s data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"protection, and a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference"},{"text":" that attests the wallet. It also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Start with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","type":"reference"},{"text":", then the article for each task.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStore":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"CredentialStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialstore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s credentials, as opaque records kept by ID under the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform’s data protection. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is the standard one."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CredentialStore"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialStatus":{"title":"CredentialStatus","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentia